Project Development Phase
# ComicCraft-AI: Comic Story Creator Using Gemini Models

 ## Project Development Phase

 ### 1\. Introduction

 The **Project Development Phase** is the implementation stage of ComicCraft-AI. In this phase, the system design is converted into a working application using frontend technologies, backend services, database integration, and **Google Gemini models**.

 The main goal is to develop an application that allows users to enter a simple comic idea and generate a complete structured comic story with characters, scenes, dialogues, and comic panels.

---

 ## 2\. Development Objectives

 The development phase focuses on:

 - Developing the user-friendly web interface.
- Implementing user authentication.
- Connecting the application to a database.
- Integrating Gemini models.
- Implementing AI-based story generation.
- Developing character-generation functionality.
- Implementing scene and dialogue generation.
- Creating a comic-panel planning system.
- Providing editing and regeneration features.
- Implementing project saving and loading.
- Providing comic-story export functionality.

