 # 8\. Story Generation Development

 The user enters the basic idea of the comic.

 ### Input

```
Story Idea:
"A student discovers a robot hidden under his school."

Genre:
Science Fiction

Tone:
Comedy

Length:
Short
```

 The backend sends these details to Gemini.

 ### Processing

```
User Input
     ↓
Frontend
     ↓
Backend API
     ↓
Gemini Model
     ↓
Generated Story
     ↓
Frontend
```

 ### Generated Output

 The system may return:

 - Title
- Synopsis
- Beginning
- Main conflict
- Climax
- Ending

