 # 10\. Character Generation Development

 After generating the story, the application can request character information from Gemini.

 ### Example Input

```
Generate characters for this story:

"Alex discovers a robot under his school..."
```

 ### Generated Character

```
Name: Alex
Role: Main Character
Personality: Curious, humorous and adventurous
Appearance: School student with a backpack
Background: Interested in science and technology
```

 Multiple characters can be generated for the same project.

